WEBVTT

00:11:29.815 --> 00:11:30.973
What is that?

00:11:30.997 --> 00:11:34.437
AK: So opportunity is a measure
of how many chances

00:11:34.461 --> 00:11:37.217
the virus has to spread
through interactions

00:11:37.241 --> 00:11:38.709
while someone is infectious.

00:11:38.733 --> 00:11:41.058
So typically, it's a measure
of social behavior.

00:11:41.646 --> 00:11:45.014
On average, how many
social contacts do people make

00:11:45.038 --> 00:11:48.529
that create opportunities for transmission
while they're infectious.

00:11:48.553 --> 00:11:53.696
CA: So it's how many people
have you got close enough to

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:56.095
during a day, during a given day,

00:11:56.119 --> 00:11:58.063
to have a chance of infecting them.

00:11:58.087 --> 00:12:00.990
And that number could be,